---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="GymAI Club — Account and Data Deletion"
  description="You can delete your GymAI Club account and all data linked to it at any time."
>
  <Nav lang="en" slug="delete-account" />
  <main class="info-page wrap">
    <section class="info-hero">
      <h1>GymAI Club — Account and Data Deletion</h1>
      <p>You can delete your GymAI Club account and all data linked to it at any time.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="info-card legal" aria-label="GymAI Club — Account and Data Deletion">
      <h2>From the app (fastest)</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Open the GymAI Club app and sign in.</li>
        <li>Go to Settings.</li>
        <li>Tap "Delete My Account and Data".</li>
        <li>After your sign-in method is verified again, your account and data are deleted immediately.</li>
      </ol>

      <h2>If you no longer have the app</h2>
      <p>Send an email with the subject "Account deletion request" to <a href="mailto:gymaiclub01@gmail.com?subject=Account%20deletion%20request">gymaiclub01@gmail.com</a> from the email address registered to your account. After verifying your identity, we will delete your account and data within 30 days and confirm by email.</p>

      <h2>Data that is deleted</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Your account and sign-in details</li>
        <li>Your profile (name, date of birth, gender, height, weight, goals)</li>
        <li>Your workouts, plans, streaks and badges</li>
        <li>Your water, nutrition and activity records</li>
        <li>Your yoga sessions</li>
        <li>Your notification records and notification settings</li>
        <li>Your profile photo</li>
        <li>Personal data related to the AI calorie estimate feature (usage counter and votes)</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Data that is kept</h2>
      <p>Your camera feed is never sent to our servers; rep counting runs entirely on your device. After deletion, no personal data linked to your account is kept.</p>

      <p>More details: <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer lang="en" />
</BaseLayout>
